docs {
  # List Group Attachments
  
  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/group/:group_id`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token: active squad member or platform admin)
  
  ## Description
  
  Retrieves paginated attachments associated with a specific group (such as gallery images, videos, and group cover).
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Path Parameters
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Unique ID of the group |
  
  ### Query Parameters
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | `integer` | No | Page number (default: 1) |
  | `page_size` | `integer` | No | Items per page (default: 20) |
  | `type` | `string` | No | Filter by attachment type (`PROFILE_IMAGE`, `GROUP_COVER`, `GALLERY_IMAGE`, `EXPENSE_RECEIPT`, `SETTLEMENT_RECEIPT`, `GALLERY_VIDEO`) |
  
  ### Headers
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "uploader_user_id": 1,
          "group_id": 1,
          "type": "GALLERY_IMAGE",
          "original_filename": "group-event.jpg",
          "file_size_bytes": 1048576,
          "mime_type": "image/jpeg",
          "access_url": "https://storage.example.com/uploads/group-event.jpg",
          "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:00:00Z"
        }
      ],
      "total": 1,
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 20,
      "total_pages": 1
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid group ID format or invalid pagination parameters
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Requester is not an active member of this group
}
